menu "mbedTLS Configuration"

config MMMBEDTLS_ECP_OPTIMISATIONS
	bool "Optimised elliptic curve arithmetic"
	default y
	help
	  Enable MBEDTLS_HAVE_ASM and MBEDTLS_ECP_NIST_OPTIM in the morselib
	  mbedTLS library. These significantly reduce the time taken by the
	  elliptic curve operations in the WPA3-SAE handshake, at a cost of
	  approximately 2kB of ROM.

endmenu
